// @ens-test --jobs 1
// @exit 1
// @stdout-contains FAIL first test exits: the test ended the program with code 0
// @stdout-contains FAIL second test fails
// @stdout-contains 0/2 tests passed
// A test that ends the program with 0 before its result is in has not passed: it fails with the
// code, and the failing test after it still runs and fails.
